ame>Hutzinger</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Sate</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Zitko</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Chemistry of PCB's</source><year>1983</year><publisher-name>Malabar: Robert E. Krieger Publishing Company</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bergman</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Klasson</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuroki</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Nilsson</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Synthesis and Mass-Spectrometry of Some Methoxylated Pcb</article-title><source>Chemosphere</source><year>1995</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>1921</fpage><lpage>1938</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0045-6535(95)00073-H</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tampal</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Lehmler</surname><given-names>H-J</given-names></name><name><surname>Espandiari</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Malmberg</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>LW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Glucuronidation of hydroxylated polychlorinated biphenyls (PCBs)</article-title><source>Chem Res Toxicol</source><year>2002</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>1259</fpage><lpage>1266</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12387623</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/tx0200212</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brandao</surname><given-names>TAS</given-names></name><name><surname>Priebe</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Dama